# 24. Lazy Evaluation

One of the biggest differences from traditional SQL execution.

### Transformations

These don't immediately execute the computation:

```python
df.filter(...)
df.select(...)
df.withColumn(...)
df.groupBy(...)
df.join(...)
```

### Actions

These trigger execution:

```python
df.show()
df.count()
df.collect()
df.write...
```

Think:

```text
Transformation
      ↓
Transformation
      ↓
Transformation
      ↓
      ACTION
      ↓
Spark executes the plan
```

